
% Behind These Hazel Eyes

a: vi . . IV | I . . V |
In: $a*2
aa: vi | IV | I | V |
Vr: $aa*4
PCh: IV | vi | IV | V |
aa_turnaround: vi | IV | ii |
Ch: $aa*2 $aa_turnaround $a
b: ii . . V | ii . . vi |
b_cad: ii . . V | ii | IV | V |
bridge: $b $b_cad
a_turnaround: vi . . IV | V | . R . . |
link: $a $a_turnaround
S: [A] $In $Vr $PCh $Ch $Vr $PCh $Ch $bridge $link $Ch*2
